 "remarks": "A Charming Furnished Retreat in the Heart of New Canaan  Enjoy the best of New Canaan living in this beautifully renovated, fully furnished home, ideally situated on a quiet cul-de-sac just blocks from the vibrant village center. Available January 1 for a flexible 3-6 month stay, this inviting home offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, and convenience.  The thoughtfully designed second floor features two inviting bedrooms and a lovely renovated bath. The main level offers an open, welcoming floor plan with an updated kitchen and charming living area, ideal for everyday living and entertaining. A walk-out lower level provides wonderful additional space for recreation, relaxation, or gathering with friends.  Outdoors, beautifully landscaped, fenced grounds create a private setting, while the welcoming deck offers the perfect spot to enjoy a morning coffee or unwind at the end of the day.  A wonderful opportunity to enjoy a turnkey furnished home in one of Fairfield County's most desirable communities, with New Canaan's shops, restaurants, train, and village amenities just moments away.",
